@* What every host draws its views in, written once for both (ADR-0052,
   amendment 2026-11-25): the operator's theme over all of it (Themed), the
   bar above with what the host adds to it (TopNav), the view, and the
   status bar fixed at the window's foot (StatusBar), so every view of
   either host has the one bar. *@
<Themed>
    <TopNav>@Links</TopNav>
    @ChildContent
    <StatusBar />
</Themed>

@code {
    /// <summary>What the host adds to the bar after the nine views.</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public RenderFragment? Links { get; set; }

    /// <summary>The view.</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public RenderFragment? ChildContent { get; set; }
}
